Both failures reported the same term 37, so I suspect the problem is in the coefficient sum. There, `t3·c3` and `t4·c4` land on the same level with different multiplication histories. This attempt keeps the baseline recurrence for t2 through t5, so those terms sit at distinct levels. It shortens only the top by using `t6 = 2·t3² − 1` and `t7 = 2·t3·t4 − z`.

